{"ward": "6", "status": "Under Review", "address": "5500 19TH AVE", "province": "ON", "description": "a) sever and convey a parcel of land with an approximate lot frontage of 50 metres and an approximate lot area of 17,914.4 square metres (1.791hectares) (Part 1); and 
